Cell["\<\
HomotopyMoveType[walk1, walk2] classifies the elementary move walk1 -> walk2 \
as \"Contract\" (walk shortens), \"Extend\" (walk lengthens), or \"Lateral\" \
(walks have the same length; only possible for moves that swap arcs of equal \
length on an even-length null-homotopic cycle).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"10ae0f55-6cdb-405b-9fb0-5766fdb8fe04"],

